    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BETTY: She’s just like me. Screw cancer. I want to be an even golden brown. Everywhere.\nBETTY: Well, everybody’s back this year. The Gales. The Hutchisons. The Campbells, sans Ben because of the trial. Insider trading. The Smythes. Oh,…\nBETTY: So, do you think you will? Pam?\nPAM: Do I think I will, what?",
      "JOAN: Can I help you with this, too, Pam?\nPAM: Oh. No. Thank you. We’ve kind of got a system.",
      "PAM: It’s dumb...\nJOAN: Well, now we have to hear it.\nPAM: One time I went to this luau and passed out in the dunes, too. That’s basically it.\nJOAN: ... Oh, how funny.",
      "PAM: It’s fine. I’m a caterer. I love cooking for people.\nJOAN: You cater? That makes sense.",
      "BETTY: Be sure to get some clams. They were all my doing this year.\nPAM: Bring your food over here and eat with me, okay?"
    ]
